📊 Finance Budget Performance Dashboard (2024–2026)
Overview

This project is an interactive Finance Budget Performance Dashboard developed using Looker Studio with Google Sheets as the data source. The dashboard provides comprehensive insights into budget planning, actual expenditures, and financial performance across departments, regions, and expense categories.

This is my first Business Intelligence dashboard project, created as part of my learning journey in Business Analytics. During the development process, I used Claude AI as a learning assistant to understand concepts, refine calculations, improve dashboard design, and enhance data storytelling while building the dashboard myself.

🎯 Objectives

Compare Budgeted vs. Actual expenditures
Analyze budget variance
Monitor department performance
Identify over-budget and under-budget spending
Track monthly financial trends
Support data-driven decision-making through interactive visualizations
📈 Dashboard Features

Total Budget KPI
Total Actual KPI
Budget Variance
Variance Percentage
Over Budget Count
Under Budget Count
Department-wise Budget Comparison
Budget Distribution by Department
Category-wise Variance Analysis
Monthly Budget vs. Actual Trend
Interactive Filters (Date, Region, Department, Category)
Detailed Financial Transaction Table
